 "conclusion": "The preregistered D2-AH pre-flight failed its fixed abort rule and the direction closes as a negative preflight. The author's metric geometric recipe at 60,384,668 processed windows, 98.3 percent of the D2-X budget, reads xy_points_err 5.7623 against D2-X 4.050520 (+42.3 percent) and end_obj_trans_err 5.4176 against 3.740209 (+44.8 percent), failing both gates. The preregistered tree-effect control then confirmed the failure rather than excusing it: seven of the eight comparable metrics reproduce the earlier epoch500 row within 1.61 percent relative, but end_obj_trans_err moves +0.3642 cm (+11.0 percent), a real metric-specific tree effect on one of the two gate metrics. Even crediting epoch100 that entire correction leaves it at 5.05 against D2-X 3.7402, while the xy_points_err tree effect of +0.0173 is about 99 times too small to cover a 1.7118 cm shortfall. What this refutes is the affordability of the remedy, not the dimensional diagnosis: at 299,531,868 windows, 4.88 times the formal budget, the same recipe beats D2-X on xy_points_err by 0.8198 cm, contact F1 by 0.0286, contact recall by 0.0493 and hand penetration by 0.0517, and its contact_percent 0.5311 sits closer to the ground truth 0.66188 than D2-X's 0.47655. The epoch100 penetration and foot-sliding advantages are engagement artefacts: its contact_percent is 0.3192 against a ground truth of 0.66188, and its penetration ratios fall to 0.543 and 0.570 of D2-X in proportion, whereas epoch500 raises engagement above D2-X and lowers hand penetration at the same time. Separately, and reprioritising the remaining work: on end_obj_trans_err D2-X (3.7402) is statistically indistinguishable from the author's own from-scratch recipe at 4.88x budget (3.6866, paired CI [-0.3798, 0.2521] crossing zero), so the gap to the released checkpoint (3.0372) is not attributable to the diffusion training recipe; the in-house consistency reproduction reads 3.5553, so distillation accounts for only part of the residual and the rest is unexplained. No formal training was started, no run id was allocated and no checkpoint was produced.",
 "next_action": "Do not implement config_train_hoi_prior_d2ah.yaml, do not start D2-AH training, and do not retry with an intermediate weight, which would be an unregistered sweep forbidden by AGENTS.md and docs/HOIPRIOR_ITERATION_WORKFLOW.md. Carry the end-object finding forward as a redirection: stop attributing the end_obj_trans_err gap to the diffusion training recipe and examine the consistency stage and the still-unexplained residual instead. Any new direction requires a fresh dated plan amendment, a registry hypothesis and explicit user approval.",
